sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as Agent session (tmux)
    participant Adapter as Session adapter
    participant Log as Event log
    participant Reducer as StatusReducer
    participant Advisor as Advisor (headless claude)
    participant Actuator as Actuator
    participant Planner as DeliveryPlanner
    participant Inbox as Web inbox
    participant Dev as Developer

    Agent->>Adapter: hook event turn_ended with a question
    Adapter->>Log: append SessionEvent (session_id, cursor, kind turn_ended)
    Log->>Reducer: read from last acked cursor
    Reducer->>Reducer: status turn_ended
    Reducer->>Advisor: last turn as untrusted data
    Advisor-->>Reducer: Verdict and Decision

    alt Malformed advisor reply (fail closed)
        Reducer->>Planner: escalate with evidence, never drop
    else Decision action answer, policy and deny list pass
        Reducer->>Actuator: Decision (rule_id, risk_tier, reply)
        Actuator->>Actuator: check policy, HardDenyList, shape, confidence
        Actuator->>Log: write Intent (intent_id)
        Actuator->>Adapter: Command send_text
        Adapter->>Agent: tmux send-keys
        Actuator->>Log: record Effect and ledger entry with rule_id
    else Decision escalate, class Urgent
        Reducer->>Planner: escalate with options and recommended answer
        Planner->>Dev: desktop notification at once
        Planner->>Inbox: ranked item
    else Decision escalate, lower class
        Reducer->>Planner: escalate with options and recommended answer
        Planner->>Planner: wait for batch window
        Planner->>Inbox: ranked item at the window
        Dev->>Inbox: answers
        Inbox->>Actuator: reply
        Actuator->>Log: write Intent
        Actuator->>Adapter: Command send_text
        Adapter->>Agent: tmux send-keys
        Actuator->>Log: record Effect and ledger entry
    end
